use firn/tags

python is a Tag
python is a Module
python is tagged python

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.python.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.python3.withPackages((__clause_argument_0) => [__clause_argument_0.boto3])]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."python"."enable": enable "Python runtime with uv"
